BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Downtown Mystic Ghost Tours
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260102
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTSTAMP:20260820T112406Z
UID:84b25dc48e9bfb13f9ce1fcdc754@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Our Original Ghost Walk takes travelers through the historic d
 owntown Mystic landscape crossing the bascule bridge between both sides of
  the Mystic River\, guests will become immersed in the dark\, sordid and s
 upernatural history of New England’s famous seafaring village. From 17th
  century strife of colonial life amidst the Pequot Wars and the King Phill
 ip’s war to mysterious turn of the century murders\, Mystic’s history 
 was founded in darkness. As the centuries grew\, lost seafarers\, creepy c
 ryptids\, and scandalous happenings took place in our quaint seaside commu
 nity.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/downtown-mystic-ghost-tours-1
LOCATION:Liberty Pole Square\, East Main Street\, Holmes Street\, Mystic C
 T\, 06355
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/downtown-mystic-ghost-tours-1
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Paranormal Pub Crawl
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260109
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261212
DTSTAMP:20260820T112406Z
UID:7d76d5286e75cc8458cf866047eb@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Join Seaside Shadows for a spirited night out with our Paranor
 mal Pub Crawl—a thrilling “just a beer” ghost tour through Mystic’
 s most haunted and historic taverns! On the second Friday of every month\,
  March through August\, or first Friday of every month\, September through
  December sip and shiver as you enjoy three beers included with your ticke
 t while uncovering eerie tales of the supernatural.\n\nSource: https://ctv
 isit.com/events/paranormal-pub-crawl-1
LOCATION:Bank Square\, Water Street\, West Main Street\, Mystic CT\, 06355
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/paranormal-pub-crawl-1
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:"Invitation to Engage: 60 Years of Long Wharf Theatre & Beyond" Ex
 hibit
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260130
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260905
DTSTAMP:20260820T112406Z
UID:9cdde7fe28dcc5aeca76abb05dfe@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:In honor of Long Wharf Theatre’s 60th anniversary and in par
 tnership with the New Haven Museum\, this immersive exhibition invites vis
 itors to explore the company’s groundbreaking history through rare photo
 graphs\, interactive displays\, and recreated spaces like a rehearsal room
  and a production set. Rooted in the pillars of artistic innovation\, radi
 cal inclusivity\, and kaleidoscopic partnerships\, Invitation to Engage is
  more than a retrospective — it’s a call to reflect\, participate\, an
 d imagine the theatre’s next 60 years.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/ev
 ents/invitation-engage-60-years-long-wharf-theatre-beyond-exhibit
LOCATION:New Haven Museum\, 114 Whitney Avenue\, New Haven CT\, 06512
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/invitation-engage-60-years-long-wharf-theat
 re-beyond-exhibit
END:VEVENT
